      \textbf{v}_{1} & \cdots & \textbf{v}_{4}
      \end{array} \right\rbrack$ is invertible, and $A = PDP^{- 1}$, where

statement.paragraph:
$P = \left\lbrack \begin{array}{rr}
      2 & {- 3} \\
      {- 3} & 5
      \end{array} \right\rbrack$, $D = \left\lbrack \begin{array}{rr}
      1 & 0 \\
